abstract: >-
  Self-contained interactive web page with five toy views of
  holographic-membrane models (projection recall, coupled loop,
  Hebbian crystallization, calibrated refusal gate, outer-product capacity). Synthetic toy,
  classical simulation; not physical holography or quantum hardware.
